  <item>
    <title>40.新的一年，你想做“猫人”，还是“狗人”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6797b99ad74435e4a31f73d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6797b99ad74435e4a31f73d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀！预祝大家新年快乐！蛇年大吉！在新年即将到来之际，想跟大家聊一聊关于猫猫狗狗的话题~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期邀请到猫猫和狗狗的家长朋友，拥有多年养宠经验，资深代表：</span></p><span></span><p><span>猫猫家长代表-咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>狗狗家长代表-麻花</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期话题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么会选择养狗/养猫？</span></p><span></span><p><span>养狗的人只会觉得自家狗子可爱，对别的狗子无感，养猫的人觉得天下猫猫都很可爱，是这样的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果突然着火，你只能救一只宠物，你会救哪只？</span></p><span></span><p><span>都说宠物会越来越像主人，是这样的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果说你的宠物真的开口说话了，会对你说什么？你想对它说什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你有想过要如何与你的宠物告别以及处理它的身后事吗？你会愿意让你的宠物做“大体老师”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【“晒娃”时间】</span></p><span></span><p><span>咖啡家的大哥-拿铁</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtzwYw-H2iHJRHgf42hlUgDrFUqq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>咖啡家16斤的玛奇朵：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmS5bSYiERKyXjFBh2SgduGMqG4R.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>麻花家的柴柴麻球：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2hTnITrDFrUMZ5f3sEwrZIax3z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>菠萝最爱的奥利奥：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_m_UsUKNPMox1pwen55330_P3O.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>以及布布觉得颜值很高的橘和会打铃的雪宝：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuWx9WGJm3NACzuPy-PW9NQslKFI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>祝大家新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入【听友群】，一起来聊聊关于毛孩子的事儿：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiXuRcGV5_kyoPX8hSLqlJXwXjhp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期剪辑】菠萝</span></p><span></span><p><span>【片尾曲】《baby song》 by 陈奕迅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64747d80dd8534bbcaa988ce/lphZJuZQmzK6QN6cBswmRPMYUw3f.m4a" length="63785481" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhk7KsXNVdSL5Z1OI8jVxUKii4bJ.png"/>
