  <item>
    <title>34.【六一特辑】赐我一台时光机，让我回到童年去</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6659c14dad5aa5d8c2c0be1d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6659c14dad5aa5d8c2c0be1d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 12:23:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀！祝每位大朋友和小朋友都六一儿童节快乐！本期想跟大家一起乘坐时光机，回忆童年那些最简单的快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【回到童年时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 我们小时候的六一都是怎么过的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 从小时候买零食被大队老师扣分开始聊聊童年零食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a>童年那些免费的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 难忘的停电回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 儿时的天台是我永远的“安全屋”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 姑姑的夸奖，成为我记忆中永远定格的珍贵画面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 生病的时候，照顾我的妈妈尤其温柔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">44:55</a> 比起情绪稳定，更想做情绪自由的大人</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的童年有跟我们类似的地方吗？或者关于童年有什么想要分享给我们的吗？欢迎在评论区留言，或者欢迎加入【听友群】：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6UgmL-iN8YdiN4J2iFzMy0szoA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《大人》-梁静茹</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期后期：菠萝</span></p>]]></description>
